        // Buses from A also start at 05:00.
        // So simionStart must be >= 300.

        // What if simionEnd is after 23:59?
        // "last one departs not later than at 11:59 PM".
        // If Simion arrives after 23:59, he might meet buses that departed before 23:59.
        // The condition t < simionEnd handles this.
        // The condition t <= 1439 handles the bus departure limit.

        // Let's double check the "meet at start and finish" exclusion.
        // My condition: t < simionEnd (strictly less) excludes meeting at B (finish).
